// 4_world_puzzles-08
// Bug: the 5 s auto-cooldown Delay started when the close animation finishes (L568 -> L15) still calls `Activate Grapple` when the handle was sabotaged (No Escape) in the meantime, so the handle opens during the sabotage.
// Fix: `Activate Grapple` returns early while the handle is sabotaged (bGrappleSabotaged and UsesAutomaticCooldown false); the sabotage end (L30) sets UsesAutomaticCooldown back to true before it activates, so it still works.

before `Activate Grapple` {
    if !bGrappleSabotaged goto done;
    if !Not_PreBool(UsesAutomaticCooldown) goto done;
    return;
done:
}
